sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant G as GUI (Run Processing)
    participant T as ProcessingWorker (QThread)
    participant D as transactions_decorator
    participant FS as Filesystem

    U->>G: Click "Run Processing"
    G->>G: validate first/last row inputs (QIntValidator)
    G->>T: start QThread with worker
    T->>D: decorate_transactions(...)
    D->>FS: backup allTransactions.csv → backup/<timestamp>.csv
    D->>FS: load categories-dictionary.json
    D->>FS: load labels-dictionary.json
    D->>FS: read allTransactions.csv
    D->>D: replace_multiple_whitespaces
    D->>D: update_categories (per row, dictionary lookup)
    D->>D: update_labels (per row, accumulating)
    D->>D: sort_dataframe_by_date (newest first)
    D->>D: convert_decimal_separator
    D->>FS: write allTransactions.csv
    D->>T: (is_success, message)
    T->>G: finished signal
    G->>U: ConfirmationDialog + open csv directory on success
